A. Commit message:
btrfs: backport fix for double accounting race when extent_writepage_io() failed

B. Change summary:
Backported the fix to avoid double ordered extent accounting errors in extent_writepage_io(). The changes ensure that only sectors that failed submission are cleaned up, preventing double accounting issues. Adjusted error handling and sector cleanup logic to be more precise.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

